        "TileImage": "$($repository 0bcfaa18-66ca-4f98-9639-d5eebce519bb).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening,47.\r\rWe have a contract from Amanda Gilbert,CEO of B&amp;A.Last year,her best friend,Mary Wilson,got into a car accident,wich happened because she was on her phone while driving.In the accident,she struck famous freestyle singer,Danny rice.He is planning on sueing her for 100000$.She hired us to eliminate him,and his co-singer,Burt Gilbert,wich happens to be her father.She wants him dead so she can get his money from his will.\r\rFind the targets,and eliminate them.\r\r\rGood luck,47.",
